    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         ORBITX DESIGN SYSTEM — canonical palette

         Intent: a launcher for someone holding a mid-range phone in one
         hand, at night, wanting to be in-game in one tap. It should feel
         like an instrument panel, not a storefront.

         Colour world: obsidian night, ember signal, graphite steel.
         ONE accent. Red means "this is live / this is the action" — never
         decoration, never a second hue competing for attention.
         Depth is borders + surface shifts, not drop shadows.
         ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

